\fs16 \cf3 Figure 2. Blackstar AI logical component architecture
\fs19 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\cf3 The guitar audio path remains entirely inside the real-time DSP domain. The M5-class host handles asynchronous speech and intent processing. A fast command lane bypasses heavyweight inference for known stage commands. Both free-form intent and fast commands converge on deterministic validation before any typed transaction reaches the DSP.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\partightenfactor0

