\fs16 \cf3 Figure 3. LyricPilot logical component architecture
\fs19 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\cf3 LyricPilot is a constrained state-estimation product. Speech text is just one feature; it never directly drives the display. PositionCore considers a bounded candidate window in the approved Song Map, fuses multiple evidence scores and only emits a committed PositionDecision after state-machine and jump-safety logic.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\partightenfactor0

