\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0

\fs19 \cf3 SQLite is the correct POC and live local-store baseline because the PID explicitly calls for local performance operation and an event store. The logical schema separates configuration/master data, immutable live events and materialised state. If a future cloud catalogue or fleet service is added, the same identifiers and event contracts can be projected into PostgreSQL without changing the show-critical local model.\
