\fs16 \cf3 Figure 8. ML lifecycle and live authority boundary
\fs19 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\cf3 There are two distinct ML problems and they should not share a monolithic model. Blackstar requires speech recognition plus semantic intent interpretation into a fixed schema; LyricPilot requires speech/acoustic feature extraction plus constrained position scoring. Each model bundle must be independently benchmarked, versioned and replaceable behind a stable adapter contract.\

