\fs36 \cf4 \uc0\u8232 9. Security, privacy and safety architecture\
\pard\tx20\tx360\pardeftab720\li360\fi-360\sl276\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4\fs19 \cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Performance Lock is a central policy state consumed by UI, data stores, model management, command routing and validators; it rejects edits, downloads and model swaps during a show.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Local secrets use platform secure storage; sensitive database fields use encryption where appropriate; logs redact tokens and unnecessary lyric/audio content.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Every asset in a show manifest has a cryptographic checksum. Entry to Performance Lock fails closed if a required model, preset, IR, Song Map or other asset is missing or mismatched.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone DSP validation is default-deny for unknown parameters, out-of-range values, locked attributes, prohibited routing and safety-critical ownership.\
\pard\tx20\tx360\pardeftab720\li360\fi-360\sl276\slmult1\sa480\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f4 \cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Audio capture for evaluation is opt-in and separated from operational telemetry. Replay bundles should support selective redaction/deletion while preserving engineering timing data.\
