\fs19 \cf3 This plan is an engineering expansion of the uploaded Blackstar PID. It preserves the PID's explicit decisions: two independently gateable products; local-first live operation; deterministic safety boundaries; SQLite for the Blackstar POC event/performance store; native Swift/SwiftUI modularity for LyricPilot; a model-agnostic intent API; constrained Song Map position tracking; and an optional shared Performance Event Bus.}